WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:23.021 --> 00:00:25.301
- [Narrator] Turning of
the bones or famadihana

00:00:25.301 --> 00:00:27.919
is a funeral tradition
of the Malagasy people

00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:29.086
in Madagascar.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.328
On the fifth, seventh, or
ninth anniversary of a death,

00:00:33.328 --> 00:00:34.741
the remains of family members

00:00:34.741 --> 00:00:36.229
are dug up from their crypt,

00:00:36.229 --> 00:00:37.847
and re-wrapped.

00:00:37.847 --> 00:00:41.514
It's a celebration that
lasts multiple days.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:07.122
(yells in foreign language)

00:01:07.122 --> 00:01:10.300
The event is larger than a
wedding or even a funeral.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.301
As the family have years of notice,

00:01:12.301 --> 00:01:14.968
everyone is expected to attend.

